  "content": "<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Uk3k_4UMOI0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我的「暗黑天際」材質包包含完全自訂的星空、一對系外行星、太陽、混沌之月、流星以及多層雲彩，能提升您Java版Minecraft的視覺體驗。這個天空材質包的創作靈感來自多個我喜愛的黑暗奇幻世界，同時也收錄在我的「暗黑戰鬥組合包」中。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">請注意，自訂天空盒需要安裝<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a>或<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabricskyboxes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Skyboxes</a>才能完整顯示。若未使用Optifine或Fabric，您將僅能看到自訂的太陽與月亮紋理。「暗黑天際」與多數資源包都能完美搭配，但特別設計來與我的「暗黑資源包合集」相輔相成，您可在下方找到相關連結。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grimdark-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/682/547/grimdark-toolspack-hero23b.jpg\" alt=\"暗黑工具包\" width=\"277\" height=\"157\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grimdark-armor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/511/33/cover-grimdarkarmor-4.png\" alt=\"暗黑盔甲包\" width=\"277\" height=\"157\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grimdark-battlepack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/433/117/cover-grimdarkbattlepack-116andnewer.png\" alt=\"暗黑戰鬥組合包\" width=\"277\" height=\"157\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>訂閱YouTube頻道獲取最新消息</strong></span><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/kalam0n\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aDa6i6R.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"96\"></a></div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>加入Patreon支持本專案</strong></span><br><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kalam0n\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mYKbR7v.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"96\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:10px\">*遊戲截圖與影片錄製於<a style=\"color:#999\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/project/acarnion/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Acarnion</a>伺服器</span></p>",
